    {
      "Id": "f9cba407-9b19-4888-9a4c-736fa8a6a592",
      "Description": "The [Length] operator computes the magnitude of a vector.\nThis is often useful when distance-like behavior is needed."
    },
    {
      "Id": "1ab11278-6c34-4a3e-9e34-140d14f92ba3",
      "Description": "In this example, draw a circle large enough to touch a random point.\nThe [Vec2ToVec3] operator can be used to add a missing component so connections work correctly."
    },
